{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "batch_norm_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, num_channels, height, width]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[num_channels]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[num_channels]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_mean",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[num_channels]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_var",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[num_channels]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as input"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "执行 BatchNorm2d 的 inference 模式：y = (x - running_mean) / sqrt(running_var + eps) * weight + bias",
        "对整个 batch 的每个通道独立应用，保持输入 shape。",
        "等价于 torch.nn.BatchNorm2d(num_channels, eps=eps).forward(input)，其中 module 处于 eval 模式且 track_running_stats=True。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "group_norm_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, num_channels, height, width]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "num_groups",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as input"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "执行 F.group_norm(input, num_groups, weight=None, bias=None, eps=eps)。",
        "将通道分为 num_groups 组，每组计算均值和方差，然后归一化。",
        "由于 weight 和 bias 为 None，使用单位缩放和零偏移。",
        "按 batch 中每个样本独立计算，保持输入 shape。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "histc_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch, num_channels, height, width]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bins",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "min",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "max",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[bins]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "计算输入张量的直方图，与 torch.histc(input, bins=bins, min=min, max=max) 语义一致。",
        "将输入元素分配到 bins 个等宽区间中，返回每个区间的计数，类型为 float32。",
        "区间范围为 [min, max]，包含 min 不包含 max（最后一个区间包含 max）。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.batch_norm(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "BatchNorm2d 推理，使用 running_mean、running_var、weight、bias 和 eps 计算归一化。",
        "输出 shape 与输入相同。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = self.group_norm(x, self.group_num)",
      "semantics": [
        "GroupNorm 无 affine 参数，按组归一化。",
        "输出 shape 与输入相同。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "x = torch.histc(x, bins=self.bins.shape[0], min=0, max=1)",
      "semantics": [
        "计算直方图，bins 数量为 self.bins.shape[0]（即构造时传入的 num_bins）。",
        "输出是一维张量，shape 为 [bins]，dtype float32。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_004",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回最终的直方图张量。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}